---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { site, email } from '../site';
---

<Base title={`Privacy · ${site.name}`} description="What happens to the details you email to Lemni Works.">
  <Header />
  <main id="main" class="wrap section prose">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p class="muted small">Last updated October 2026.</p>

    <h2>What this site collects</h2>
    <p>
      This site uses Cloudflare Web Analytics to measure page views and loading performance. Cloudflare describes how
      these metrics are collected in its <a href="https://developers.cloudflare.com/web-analytics/about/">Web Analytics documentation</a>.
      This site does not include advertising tools.
    </p>
    <p>
      The contact link opens your email app. When you email me, I receive your email address and whatever details you
      choose to include in your message.
    </p>

    <h2>What I do with it</h2>
    <p>
      I use your message to reply to you and, if we work together, to keep track of the project. I do not sell your
      contact details or add you to a mailing list.
    </p>

    <h2>How long I keep it</h2>
    <p>
      Messages that do not turn into work are deleted within 12 months. If you would like yours deleted sooner, email{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> and I will delete it within one week of your request.
    </p>

    <h2>Where it is stored</h2>
    <p>
      Cloudflare hosts this website. Inquiries and replies go through my Google business mailbox. This site does not
      currently submit contact messages to a form service or a separate database.
    </p>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .prose {
    padding-top: 160px;
    max-width: calc(680px + 2 * var(--gutter));
    margin-inline: 0;
  }

  .prose h1 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 5vw, 56px);
  }

  .prose h1 + p {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 22px;
    margin-top: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .prose p + p {
    margin-top: 12px;
  }
</style>
